# Research OS

A production-ready AI Research Assistant built using LangGraph, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Redis, and ChromaDB. It performs multi-agent research by gathering information from the web, research papers, and uploaded documents, then generates a structured research report with built-in evaluation and production-grade optimizations.

---

## Features

- Multi-Agent workflow using LangGraph
- Web, Research Paper, and Document Retrieval
- RAG with ChromaDB
- PDF Upload & Semantic Search
- Long-Term Memory
- Redis Response Caching
- LLM Retry & Fallback
- Input Guardrails
- Research Evaluation
- LangSmith Observability
- Rate Limiting
- Research History Management

---

## Tech Stack

- FastAPI
- LangGraph
- LangChain
- LiteLLM
- Mistral AI
- Gemini (Fallback)
- Redis
- PostgreSQL
- ChromaDB
- Tavily Search

---

## Architecture

```text
                User Query
                     │
                     ▼
           Input Guardrails
                     │
                     ▼
             Memory / Cache
                     │
         ┌───────────┴───────────┐
         │                       │
     Cache Hit              Cache Miss
         │                       │
         ▼                       ▼
   Cached Response          Research Planner
                                 │
                 ┌───────────────┼───────────────┐
                 ▼               ▼               ▼
            Web Agent      Paper Agent     Docs Agent
                 └───────────────┼───────────────┘
                                 ▼
                        Context Builder
                                 ▼
                          Writer Agent
                                 ▼
                          Critic Agent
                                 ▼
                       Output Guardrails
                                 ▼
                      Evaluation & Storage
                                 ▼
                              Response
```

---

## APIs

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/research` | Generate research report |
| GET | `/research/history` | Get research history |
| GET | `/research/{id}` | Get research by ID |
| DELETE | `/research/{id}` | Delete research |
| POST | `/research/upload` | Upload PDF |

---

## Production Features

- Redis Cache for reduced latency
- Retry with Exponential Backoff
- LLM Fallback Support
- Input & Output Guardrails
- LangSmith Tracing
- Response Evaluation
- Rate Limiting
- Parallel Agent Execution

